  2006	## Freeze statement
  2007	
  2008	**This file is frozen by the author's commit containing it**, and nothing
  2009	in the capstone may be written or run before that commit (ENUM §5;
  2010	`LEDGER.md:1261-1262`). After the freeze: (1) **the model is built by a
  2011	builder who may not edit this file**, and every prediction above is read
  2012	as written; (2) **results go to `formal/suite/capstone/RESULTS.md`**,
  2013	never here; (3) **recuts for encoding are logged** in a "Recuts
  2014	(encoding, not property)" section of `RESULTS.md` on the S-P3 pattern
  2015	(`s-p3/RESULTS.md:38-73`), while a recut of a **property**, of a query's
  2016	shape, or of a registered prediction is an **amendment**, appended and
  2017	dated, never a rewrite; (4) **a non-author cross-family falsification
  2018	review** then runs against the built model and its results, by a reviewer
