   958	| *"May land as `capstone_d` did"*: the standing, type and scope mutations, C-C9 through C-C18 (other than C-C17) | **All thirteen landed**, in 1 377 s to 7 942 s: C-C9, C-C10, C-C11 and its two alternates, C-C12, C-C13(i)/(ii), C-C15(i)/(ii)/(iii), C-C16, C-C18. |
