   962	held for 2 of the 4 failures. The one configuration left unpredicted failed.
   963	*(REPAIR 2026-10-01, skeptic S-9.)* Two qualifications. First, the thirteen were predicted only as *“may
   964	land”*, which is hedged: it would not have been falsified by a failure, so counting the thirteen landings as
   965	predictions that held overstates the score. The unhedged part is the four *“likely to time out”*, all of
