  1739	and is narrowed here; the sentence is kept as written.)* What the ladder shows: `HonestChain` is reachable
  1740	at `L0`, `L1` and `L2`, each by its own query; `HonestAccepted` is reachable; `HonestWrappedAccepted` is
  1741	reachable on a genuinely wrapped acceptance (its judge fires only on a `wctx` context, and the printed trace
