  1814	neither.** §3's timeboxes bound **time**; nothing in the registration bounds **memory**, and memory is
  1815	what has twice stopped this ladder. Measured resident sets, 2026-09-19: the correct strict model's
  1816	process is small enough never to have been noticed; a **companion** grows to **1.0-3.7 GB**; the
  1817	**degraded** correct-form run to **9 GB**; and **case (c) — both channel keys public — to over 20 GB
